id>\" or null, \"reason\": null | \"ROVER_UNAVAILABLE\" | \"NO_DRONE_TASK_REACHES_WAIT_POINT\" | \"TARGET_NOT_DECLARED\"}]}, \"verify\": [{\"tool\": \"<name>\", \"arguments\": {...}}], \"explanation\": \"<short>\"}\n\nGive exactly ONE decision for every objective in CONTEXT objectives, using only the facts there:\n- PLAN_TO_DECLARED_POI when the rover is available, the objective's point is a declared POI and, if it waits for a\n  drone, wait_point_reached_by_proposed_drone_task is true; target_point is the objective's point_id. Do not give a\n  wait point: the runtime derives it from the objective.\n- WAIT_FOR_OBSERVATION with target_point null for an objective whose target comes from a future observation.\n- CANNOT_PLAN with exactly one reason otherwise: ROVER_UNAVAILABLE, NO_DRONE_TASK_REACHES_WAIT_POINT or\n  TARGET_NOT_DECLARED; target_point null.\nLocalization and authorization are checked later by the executor and a human: they are never a reason here.\nRequest validate_ground_target for each planned target.\nTOOLS: [{\"arguments\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"target_point\": {\"maxLength\": 40, \"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Target Point\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"target_point\"], \"title\": \"GroundTargetArgs\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"description\": \"straight ground route from the rover's declared start to a declared POI (drivable area, exclusions)\", \"name\": \"validate_ground_target\"}, {\"arguments\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"aerial_points\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"maxItems\": 20, \"title\": \"Aerial Points\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"point\": {\"maxLength\": 40, \"minLength\": 1, \"title\": \"Point\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"point\"], \"title\": \"DependencyArgs\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"description\": \"whether a drone task of the current proposal reaches a point the rover must wait for\", \"name\": \"check_dependency\"}]\nTASK (data): {\"aerial_po